  "description": "THE MOST ADVANCED MOBILITY APP FOR SPORTS PERFORMANCE\nAlready trusted by 1.7 million athletes\n\nGIVE YOUR MOVEMENT MEANING\nTest your mobility and flexibility for free and discover how they impact your athletic performance.\nAccess personalized mobility protocols designed to optimize your movement, relieve stress, improve recovery, and enhance your daily vitality.\n\nPERSONALIZED MOBILITY FOR YOU AND YOUR SPORTS\nMove like new in everything you do with GOWOD’s multi-sport approach:\n- Tailored mobility and stretching routines for your sport, weaknesses, and specific needs.\n- Over 50 sports covered, including CrossFit®, Running, Triathlon, Hyrox, Trail Running, Bodybuilding, and more.\n- No more guesswork, unlock new sensations and unleash your full potential with personalized routines.\n\nMEASURABLE PROGRESS, REAL RESULTS\n- Take the free mobility test to establish your baseline.\n- Track your mobility level for each sport and compare your stats.\n- Follow your progress month after month and set personal goals to move better.\n\nSPECIFIC PROTOCOLS TO OPTIMIZE YOUR TRAINING ROUTINE\nTrain smarter and recover better with targeted mobility sessions:\n- ACTIVATE – Prepare your body for effort and maximize performance.\n- RECOVER – Reduce muscle fatigue and recover faster.\n- DAILY FLOW – Improve mobility week after week with simple, effective protocols.\n\nUPGRADE YOUR PERFORMANCE WITH GOWOD\nStop guessing how to move better, GOWOD adapts to your movement. Whether you’re optimizing your training, unlocking better movement patterns, or boosting your performance in all the sports you love, GOWOD gives you the ultimate tool to move like new.\n\nTry GOWOD Premium and experience the impact of mobility on your performance.\n\nTerms of Use: https://www.gowod.app/terms-of-use \nPrivacy Policy: https://www.gowod.app/privacy-policy",
